  "content": "\n\n<p>Telegram:<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fkapiteon_mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://t.me/kapiteon_mods</a><br><br>也可以看看我的其他模组：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nonewfog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">NoNewFog</span> (NoGrayFog) <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">(新)</span></a><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/direction-build\" rel=\"nofollow\">Direction Build </a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/direction-build\" rel=\"nofollow\">(按住鼠标右键时辅助单向建造)</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastbuilder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Builder </a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastbuilder\" rel=\"nofollow\">(同样包含快速破坏功能)</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClearVision </a></span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">(夜视 + 全亮度 + 液体透视)</a><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><br></span></span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keybinder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Command Binder </a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/keybinder\" rel=\"nofollow\">(按键宏)</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>FreeCam</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Freecam 是一款 Forge 模组，允许你以<em>旁观者</em>身份在 Minecraft 世界中<em>飞行</em>。即使在<em>在线</em>服务器上也能正常使用。Freecam 有助于探索地下世界或建造工厂。你可以以任何方式穿过任意方块。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在线服务器、其他玩家和生物会看到你静止在一个位置。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>按 F6 键以启用/禁用 <em>FreeCam&nbsp;</em>模式<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建议将本模组与亮度模组&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clearvision-nightvision-fullbrightness-fluidvision\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClearVision</a>&nbsp;<strong>搭配使用</strong>（按 <strong>F7</strong> <strong>激活 ClearVision</strong>）</span></p>",
